# Privacy Policy for Trim Copy

Effective date: February 20, 2026

Trim Copy ("the Extension") is designed to trim leading/trailing whitespace from user-selected text and copy the cleaned text to the clipboard after the user clicks the extension button.

## 1. Data Collection

Trim Copy does not collect, store, sell, or share personal data.

## 2. How the Extension Works

- The Extension runs only after user action (clicking the extension button).
- It reads only the text the user has selected on the current page.
- It trims leading and trailing whitespace from that selected text.
- It writes the cleaned text to the system clipboard.

## 3. Data Transmission

Trim Copy does not send data to external servers.  
No analytics, tracking, or remote logging is used.

## 4. Data Storage

Trim Copy does not store user content or personal data locally or remotely.

## 5. Permissions Used

- `activeTab`: temporary access to the currently active tab after user click.
- `scripting`: executes trim-and-copy logic in the current tab after user action.

## 6. Third-Party Services

Trim Copy does not use third-party services to process user data.

## 7. Children's Privacy

Trim Copy is not directed to children and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## 8. Changes to This Policy

If this policy changes, the updated version will be reflected with a new effective date.

## 9. Contact

For privacy questions, contact the publisher through the Chrome Web Store listing support channel.
